   $ex${"titre":"Décrire la photo du parc","competence":"se-reperer-espace","situation":"Pour l’oral de l’épreuve, Yanis doit décrire une photo. Son plan simplifié est ci-dessous, avec le brouillon de sa description.","documents":[{"id":"photo","type":"schema","titre":"The photo","largeur":340,"hauteur":220,"elements":[{"forme":"rect","x":10,"y":10,"l":320,"h":200,"teinte":"gris","motif":"clair"},{"forme":"rect","x":22,"y":22,"l":90,"h":38,"texte":"windmill","id":"z1","zone":true},{"forme":"rect","x":228,"y":22,"l":90,"h":38,"texte":"church","id":"z2","zone":true},{"forme":"rect","x":115,"y":88,"l":110,"h":40,"teinte":"bleu","texte":"lake","id":"z3","zone":true},{"forme":"rect","x":22,"y":160,"l":90,"h":38,"texte":"bench","id":"z4","zone":true},{"forme":"rect","x":228,"y":160,"l":90,"h":38,"texte":"bike","id":"z5","zone":true}],"source":"Plan imaginé pour l’exercice"},{"id":"desc","type":"texte","genre":"recit","titre":"Yanis’s draft","blocs":["In the foreground, a bench is at the left and a bike is on the right. The lake is on the centre of the picture. A church stands in the top right-hand corner. The bench and the bike are in the bottom of the photo."],"source":"Brouillon écrit pour l’exercice, avec des erreurs"}],"questions":[{"enonce":"Touche les trois prépositions fautives dans le brouillon de Yanis.","aide":"À gauche et à droite : *on*. Au centre : *in*. En haut ou en bas : *at*.","type":"zone","document":"desc","multiple":true},{"enonce":"Sur le plan, touche ce qui se trouve *in the middle* de la photo.","aide":"Cherche l’élément au centre du cadre.","type":"zone","document":"photo","multiple":false},{"enonce":"Corrige deux erreurs du brouillon.","aide":"Un centre est vu comme un espace ; une gauche, comme une ligne.","type":"trous","segments":["The lake is ",0," the centre and the bench is ",1," the left."],"banque":["into","at","on","in"]},{"enonce":"Quelle phrase est correcte ?","aide":"On dit *arrive at / in* (jamais *to*), et *go home* (sans *to*).","ty